        <p class="sub" style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 600; position: relative; padding-left: 94px;"><span class="q-dropcap">Q:</span>How do we rescue RFx teams from dozens of clunky, inconsistent vendor portals and give them something that's actually a pleasure to use?</p>
        <h1><span class="qa-label">A:</span>Loopio Browser Extension</h1>
        <p class="sub">The goal of this project was to replace dozens of different painful portal experiences with one consistent interface, and let AI do the scanning so a job that used to take hours of copy-pasting takes minutes. It also doubled as the first live test of our new brand.</p>
